  "_readme": [
    "Screenshot caption copy per locale, used to stamp out marketing/aso/<locale>/<platform>/params.yaml.",
    "",
    "These are MARKETING lines, not translations. Each is rewritten to be short and idiomatic in its",
    "own language, because the title renders as large display text: a literal 'Computed, not guessed'",
    "runs to twice the width in German and wraps into the screenshot. Meaning is preserved, wording",
    "is not, and length is the binding constraint.",
    "",
    "THE PRACTITIONER LAYER LEADS. The first five shots are natal, transits, synastry, dignities and",
    "returns — the features this release adds and the reason an astrologer would buy it. The live sky",
    "follows: still why the numbers are trustworthy, no longer the thing being sold.",
    "",
    "Never translated: Ephemeris Sky, NASA/JPL Horizons, Placidus, Koch, Campanus, Regiomontanus.",
    "",
    "iOS ships 8 shots, iPad and Mac ship 9 — the counts must match the raw captures, so the ios",
    "lists are 8 long and the others 9."
